(Outbound lists) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Outbound dials a loaded list under a mode. Resets and ANI changes are explicit. A list is) Tj
T*
(not a campaign Outbound and autodial campaigns dial lists of contact records. The list has) Tj
T*
(an order. The campaign has a run state and a dialing mode. Uploading a CSV does neither of) Tj
T*
(those. Profiles filter the list the agent sees Campaign profiles filter and sort lists,) Tj
T*
(control agent pop-ups, and manage disposition counts. They also override defaults such as) Tj
T*
(the ANI. One campaign, one profile. Workflow rules can swap the profile. List penetration) Tj
T*
(and vertical dialing List penetration is the default. The dialer tries the first phone on) Tj
T*
(every record, then the next phone on a later pass. Vertical dialing stays with one contact) Tj
T*
(and moves across that contact&#x27;s numbers before it moves on. Reset is a loaded gun Reset) Tj
T*
(list position sends the dialer back to the top. Reset Disposition clears selected outcomes) Tj
T*
(so those rows can dial again. Both act on lists currently loaded. The disposition topic says) Tj
T*
(to reset only codes you know are safe. Time zone and call analysis are guarded defaults The) Tj
T*
(campaign admin tree includes time zone dialing options, and the default-settings topic says) Tj
T*
(call analysis and voice detection level ship with vendor defaults. Changing defaults can) Tj
T*
(raise a compliance warning. The same topic says US domains watch abandon rate for 30 rolling) Tj
T*
(days and UK domains for 24 hours, and that a Five9 representative sets which kind of domain) Tj
T*
(you have. Call analysis is not a guarantee Call analysis and voice detection level are) Tj
T*
(defaulted campaign fields. Product pages also list answering-machine detection and automatic) Tj
T*
(voicemail as agent-efficiency tools. None of those pages give you a percent accuracy you can) Tj
T*
(put in a contract. Local caller ID is a profile choice The outbound product page lists local) Tj
T*
(caller ID as a business-efficiency tool, and campaign profiles are the documented place to) Tj
T*
(override the default ANI. Showing a local number is a profile and number-plan problem, not a) Tj
T*
(skill-group problem.) Tj
T*
